0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Prazo Normal:<\/strong> 3.50 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 13\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">\u00daltima Hora:<\/strong> 5.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (ap\u00f3s 13\/12 (se dispon\u00edvel))<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida Kids<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">S\u00e3o Silvestre do Ber\u00e7o (at\u00e9 5 anos)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 19 Dez \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 16:00<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Prazo Normal:<\/strong> 3.50 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 13\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">\u00daltima Hora:<\/strong> 5.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (ap\u00f3s 13\/12 (se dispon\u00edvel))<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza a S\u00e3o Silvestre de Guimar\u00e3es 2026?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 2\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o da S\u00e3o Silvestre de Guimar\u00e3es realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 19 de dezembro de 2026, com partida e chegada na Rua Conde Dom Henrique, junto \u00e0 est\u00e1tua de D. Afonso Henriques, em Guimar\u00e3es (distrito de Braga).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os hor\u00e1rios de partida das v\u00e1rias provas?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O programa come\u00e7a com as provas jovens: S\u00e3o Silvestre do Ber\u00e7o (300 m) \u00e0s 16:00, Mini S\u00e3o Silvestre (500 m) \u00e0s 16:20 e S\u00e3o Silvestre da Juventude (1000 m) \u00e0s 16:40. Ap\u00f3s o aquecimento \u00e0s 17:30, a Corrida de 10 km parte \u00e0s 18:00 e a Caminhada de 4 km \u00e0s 18:10.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e prazos de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Na Corrida de 10 km, a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o custa 12,00 \u20ac at\u00e9 31 de outubro, 15,00 \u20ac de 1 a 30 de novembro, 18,00 \u20ac de 1 a 13 de dezembro e 20,00 \u20ac em \u00faltima hora. Na Caminhada de 4 km, os valores s\u00e3o de 8,00 \u20ac (at\u00e9 31\/10), 10,00 \u20ac (novembro), 12,00 \u20ac (1 a 13\/12) e 15,00 \u20ac (\u00faltima hora). As provas jovens t\u00eam o custo de 3,50 \u20ac at\u00e9 13 de dezembro (5,00 \u20ac em \u00faltima hora).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite e como funciona o acesso \u00e0 box dianteira?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O tempo m\u00e1ximo para concluir a Corrida de 10 km \u00e9 de 1 hora e 30 minutos (1 hora e 20 minutos para a Caminhada). Atletas com marcas comprovadas inferiores a 33 minutos (masculinos) ou 37 minutos (femininos) em provas certificadas de 10 km desde janeiro de 2025 podem solicitar acesso \u00e0 box dianteira at\u00e9 9 de dezembro de 2026 atrav\u00e9s do e-mail geral@saosilvestreguimaraes.pt.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem \u00e9 a entidade respons\u00e1vel pela organiza\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova \u00e9 organizada pela Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Guimar\u00e3es em Movimento, em colabora\u00e7\u00e3o t\u00e9cnica com a Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Braga e com o apoio da C\u00e2mara Municipal de Guimar\u00e3es.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"S\u00e3o Silvestre Guimar\u00e3es 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-12-19\", \"endDate\": \"2026-12-19\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Rua Conde Dom Henrique (junto \u00e0 est\u00e1tua de D. Afonso Henriques), Guimar\u00e3es\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Guimar\u00e3es\", \"addressRegion\": \"Braga\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"A S\u00e3o Silvestre de Guimar\u00e3es 2026 realiza-se a 19 de dezembro em Guimar\u00e3es. Corrida 10 km, caminhada 4 km e provas kids. Consulta hor\u00e1rios e inscreve-te j\u00e1!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-sao-silvestre-guimaraes.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Corrida S\u00e3o Silvestre 10 km\", \"price\": \"12.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/saosilvestreguimaraes.pt\/\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Caminhada S\u00e3o Silvestre 4 km\", \"price\": \"8.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/saosilvestreguimaraes.pt\/\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"S\u00e3o Silvestre da Juventude (12 a 15 anos)\", \"price\": \"3.50\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/saosilvestreguimaraes.pt\/\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Mini S\u00e3o Silvestre (6 a 11 anos)\", \"price\": \"3.50\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/saosilvestreguimaraes.pt\/\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"S\u00e3o Silvestre do Ber\u00e7o (at\u00e9 5 anos)\", \"price\": \"3.50\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/saosilvestreguimaraes.pt\/\"}], \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Guimar\u00e3es em Movimento\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza a S\u00e3o Silvestre de Guimar\u00e3es 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A 2\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o da S\u00e3o Silvestre de Guimar\u00e3es realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 19 de dezembro de 2026, com partida e chegada na Rua Conde Dom Henrique, junto \u00e0 est\u00e1tua de D. Afonso Henriques, em Guimar\u00e3es (distrito de Braga).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os hor\u00e1rios de partida das v\u00e1rias provas?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O programa come\u00e7a com as provas jovens: S\u00e3o Silvestre do Ber\u00e7o (300 m) \u00e0s 16:00, Mini S\u00e3o Silvestre (500 m) \u00e0s 16:20 e S\u00e3o Silvestre da Juventude (1000 m) \u00e0s 16:40. Ap\u00f3s o aquecimento \u00e0s 17:30, a Corrida de 10 km parte \u00e0s 18:00 e a Caminhada de 4 km \u00e0s 18:10.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e prazos de in